WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
OP

00:05.690 --> 00:07.069
Yay!

00:07.070 --> 00:09.740
I'll have books! I'll finally
have books to read!

00:10.660 --> 00:12.620
<i>Myne shall soon join the
temple as an apprentice,</i>

00:12.780 --> 00:15.250
<i>and she is overjoyed at the
thought of reading books there.</i>

00:15.660 --> 00:17.500
<i>Meanwhile...</i>

00:17.750 --> 00:19.000
Eckhart.

00:19.370 --> 00:20.500
Justus.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.459
Procure information regarding a commoner girl
named Myne, who is afflicted with the Devouring.

00:25.460 --> 00:29.260
She will be joining the temple
as an apprentice blue shrine maiden.

00:29.550 --> 00:32.510
A commoner girl with the Devouring
is becoming a blue shrine maiden?

00:32.970 --> 00:35.889
She runs a workshop where she makes
something called plant-based paper,

00:35.890 --> 00:37.389
and in order to be able to read books,

00:37.390 --> 00:41.229
she did not hesitate to offer one gold
in exchange for being made a shrine maiden.

00:41.230 --> 00:42.900
In any case, she is an odd child.

00:43.230 --> 00:45.020
An odd child?

00:45.280 --> 00:48.439
Precisely, so any information
you can provide is appreciated.

00:48.440 --> 00:49.530
Find out anything you can.

00:49.860 --> 00:50.860
Yes sir!

01:07.550 --> 01:12.089
I have a wish, just one simple wish

01:12.090 --> 01:16.600
